 county's last large greenfield sites, with the voter-approved Urban Limit Line, Delta levee and flood constraints, and refinery-transition planning shaping where the next decade of housing lands.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: November 8, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["Contra Costa County",0,[[38.0604,-122.26958],[38.05992,-122.26535],[38.06397,-122.24525],[38.0621,-122.23295],[38.06182,-122.23208],[38.06157,-122.23011],[38.06121,-122.22799],[38.06102,-122.22594],[38.06101,-122.22518],[38.06094,-122.2246],[38.05812,-122.20178],[38.05793,-122.20085],[38.054,-122.18386],[38.04777,-122.1761],[38.04663,-122.17509],[38.03944,-122.16966],[38.038,-122.16865],[38.03672,-122.16758],[38.03663,-122.16738],[38.03605,-122.16674],[38.03547,-122.16586],[38.03522,-122.1652],[38.03472,-122.16458],[38.0343,-122.1632],[38.03404,-122.1622],[38.03373,-122.16065],[38.03344,-122.16],[38.03241,-122.15351],[38.03222,-122.15186],[38.03193,-122.15025],[38.03172,-122.14858],[38.03172,-122.14708],[38.03177,-122.14518],[38.03176,-122.14312],[38.03186,-122.14153],[38.03218,-122.13937],[38.03284,-122.13714],[38.03322,-122.13609],[38.03407,-122.13317],[38.03449,-122.13154],[38.03512,-122.12783],[38.03518,-122.12707],[38.0354,-122.12568],[38.03572,-122.12397],[38.03608,-122.12316],[38.03652,-122.12254],[38.03747,-122.12174],[38.03799,-122.12099],[38.03822,-122.12009],[38.03856,-122.11925],[38.03934,-122.11808],[38.04588,-122.10276],[38.04668,-122.10055],[38.04746,-122.09873],[38.04792,-122.09707],[38.04912,-122.09337],[38.04927,-122.09313],[38.04972,-122.09032],[38.05009,-122.08875],[38.0512,-122.08575],[38.05186,-122.08416],[38.05317,-122.07983],[38.054,-122.07743],[38.05462,-122.07615],[38.06008,-122.0673],[38.06099,-122.06501],[38.06214,-122.0611],[38.0602,-122.05087],[38.0602,-122.03626],[38.05919,-122.02841],[38.06029,-122.02498],[38.06227,-122.01983],[38.06348,-122.01518],[38.06449,-122.00791],[38.06531,-122.00107],